#: src/pages/help/FAQ.tsx
msgid "An idle game built on osu!mania 4K. You don't press the keys: your character plays the maps for you. Every play earns experience in its skills, better skills mean better plays, and better plays climb the rankings."
msgstr "An idle game built on osu!mania 4K. You don't press the keys: your character plays the maps for you. Every play earns experience in its skills, better skills mean better plays, and better plays climb the rankings."

#: src/pages/beatmaps/MapRequests.tsx
msgid "Anyone can propose a map for ranking in osu!idle - osu!mania 4K only. Support the ones you want to play so it shows what people are after. Accepted maps join the nomination queue and are ranked from there."
msgstr "Anyone can propose a map for ranking in osu!idle - osu!mania 4K only. Support the ones you want to play so it shows what people are after. Accepted maps join the nomination queue and are ranked from there."

#: src/pages/help/FAQ.tsx
msgid "At overall level {REBIRTH_MIN_OVERALL_LEVEL}, you can start a brand new character one generation up. Each generation unlocks something new; the first is the Divine judgement. Your old character is not deleted: it stays playable, ranked and keeps all its progress. If the new one takes its name, the old one is renamed with _old, like on osu!."
msgstr "At overall level {REBIRTH_MIN_OVERALL_LEVEL}, you can start a brand new character one generation up. Each generation unlocks something new; the first is the Divine judgement. Your old character is not deleted: it stays playable, ranked and keeps all its progress. If the new one takes its name, the old one is renamed with _old, like on osu!."

