#: src/pages/help/FAQ.tsx
msgid "Your character has eleven skills: accuracy, speed, stamina, jack speed, coordination, release, reading, consistency, concentration, speed jam and memory. Each one levels up on its own, from the parts of a map that test it. A jack-heavy map trains jack speed, a long map trains stamina, and so on. Your overall level grows with all of them."
msgstr "Your character has eleven skills: accuracy, speed, stamina, jack speed, coordination, release, reading, consistency, concentration, speed jam and memory. Each one levels up on its own, from the parts of a map that test it. A jack-heavy map trains jack speed, a long map trains stamina, and so on. Your overall level grows with all of them."
